&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:13.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingInventoriesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;"&gt;※２．有形固定資産の減価償却累計額は次の通りであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:438.3pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:145.7pt;min-width:145.7pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:86.3pt;min-width:86.3pt;"/&gt;
